  "prefLabel": "Alc 408.03 Documentation of Peer Collaboration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Alc 408.03 Documentation of Peer Collaboration.\n\n(a) Licensees shall document each instance of peer collaboration with a photocopy of a written statement:\n\n(1) Including:\n\na. The date of the peer collaboration;\n\nb. The printed names and licenses held by each participant; and\n\nc. The duration of the peer collaboration stated in hours and minutes; and\n\n(2) Signed by the other participant(s) in the peer collaboration.\n\n(b) Licensees shall retain such documents until they are required to submit them to the OPLC:\n\n(1) As part of their applications for renewal of licensure; or\n\n(2) At any other time on the request of the board through the OPLC.\n\nSource. #12548, eff 7-1-18 (formerly Alc 403.02) ; ss by #14045, eff 10-7-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/alc100-500.html"
